    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: Embaralhe as cartas na mesa
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u041F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0441\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043A\u0430\u0440\u0442\u044B
